                  <p>Amendment of notifications</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14">
              <num>14</num>
              <heading>Subsection 7.15(1) (note)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “<date date="2016-06-30">30 June 2016</date>”, substitute “the time the measures are notified under <ref href="#sec-7">section 7</ref>.12”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-15">
              <num>15</num>
              <heading>Subsection 7.16(1) (heading)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the heading, substitute:</p>
